WEBVTT

00:45:29.828 --> 00:45:32.986
and that the more you do,
the more amazed you will be

00:45:33.010 --> 00:45:36.359
by all the different things
you will go on to be and do.

00:45:36.383 --> 00:45:39.877
And for an extrovert,
I would say, we love you --

00:45:39.901 --> 00:45:41.488
we introverts, I mean --

00:45:41.512 --> 00:45:46.438
and for all of us to know that
there is this colossal waste, currently,

00:45:46.462 --> 00:45:49.721
of talent and energy and happiness

00:45:49.745 --> 00:45:54.517
that comes from not fully understanding
and appreciating these differences,

00:45:54.541 --> 00:45:57.563
and it's really easy to fix,
which is the good news.

00:45:57.587 --> 00:45:59.104
So I hope you will join us.

00:45:59.850 --> 00:46:02.596
CA: Well, Susan, I feel very lucky
to have got to sit down